{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S11把“有时不需要”推成“即使不需要”，S13又把“没人能保证永远”改写成“即使听到也……”的别扭因果，心理动机的准确性不如Y。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X更适合边听边扫：加亮的关键词提供了明确的视觉抓手，感受词又有一部分按音乐段落出现，不必同时处理所有信息。它对音乐细节、身体感受和情绪转折的描写也更具体，前后意象呼应更容易形成听觉记忆。Y的心理叙述更准确自然，因果关系也更完整，但右侧感受词缺少时间上的对应，容易变成一组需要自行消化的情绪标签。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "050f033d-56a0-4a4f-a289-233196b2fb52", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T210333856211Z", "elapsed_seconds": 141.156, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T21:05:55.034996+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "bdd1e5e012de18b05fb31d94ce08820ee2cacd935c38ae441201e750a7e023f5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments